  "changeNotice": "Extracted only Tables S1, S2, S5, and S6 at printed ages 0 through 5 years; preserved published decimal precision and renamed P50 as M. Mapped rounded printed ages to exact calendar month-anniversary nodes 0–24, 30, 36, 42, 48, 54, and 60; this mapping is an app-authored inference. The app uses calendar month anniversaries and linear interpolation of L/M/S between these nodes, including across published model joins; this is an app-authored approximation, not the original continuous GAMLSS model. No daily rows, further rounding, smoothing, or extrapolation were introduced.",
